<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>ClueMD | Interactive Science Mysteries</title>
  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #f4f8fb;
      color: #17202a;
    }
    header {
      padding: 22px 7%;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      background: white;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    }
    .logo {
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
    }
    nav a {
      margin-left: 20px;
      color: #17202a;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .hero {
      min-height: 75vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 70px 20px;
    }
    .hero-content {
      max-width: 800px;
    }
    .tag {
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 3px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(48px, 10vw, 82px);
      line-height: 0.95;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
    }
    .hero-text {
      max-width: 650px;
      margin: 0 auto 35px;
      color: #6b7280;
      font-size: 19px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 16px 25px;
      background: #17202a;
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-weight: 800;
    }
    .button:hover {
      opacity: 0.85;
    }
    .features {
      background: white;
      padding: 75px 7%;
    }
    .features-title {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 45px;
    }
    .features-title h2 {
      font-size: 35px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    .features-title p {
      color: #6b7280;
    }
    .feature-grid {
      max-width: 1000px;
      margin: auto;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 22px;
    }
    .feature {
      padding: 28px;
      border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
      border-radius: 18px;
    }
    .icon {
      font-size: 32px;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }
    .feature h3 {
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .feature p {
      color: #6b7280;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .mission {
      padding: 75px 7%;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .mission-content {
      max-width: 750px;
      margin: auto;
    }
    .mission h2 {
      font-size: 35px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .mission p {
      color: #6b7280;
      font-size: 18px;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }
    footer {
      padding: 30px;
      text-align: center;
      background: #17202a;
      color: white;
      font-size: 13px;
    }
    @media (max-width: 800px) {
      .feature-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
      nav {
        display: none;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
  <div class="logo">
    ClueMD
  </div>
  <nav>
    <a href="index.html">Home</a>
    <a href="cases.html">Cases</a>
  </nav>
</header>
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-content">
<div class="tag">
  Interactive Science Investigation
</div>
<h1>
  Don't memorize.<br>
  Investigate.
</h1>
<p class="hero-text">
  ClueMD turns biology into a mystery.
  Interview fictional patients, uncover hidden clues,
  connect scientific evidence, and solve the case.
</p>
<a class="button" href="cases.html">
  Enter the Case Library →
</a>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="features">
  <div class="features-title">
<h2>
  How ClueMD works
</h2>
<p>
  Think like a scientist, not a memorization machine.
</p>
  </div>
  <div class="feature-grid">
<div class="feature">
  <div class="icon">
    🧑
  </div>
  <h3>
    Meet the Patient
  </h3>
  <p>
    Enter a fictional clinical scenario and interact
    with a virtual patient.
  </p>
</div>
<div class="feature">
  <div class="icon">
    🔎
  </div>
  <h3>
    Find the Clues
  </h3>
  <p>
    Ask questions, investigate symptoms, and decide
    which information actually matters.
  </p>
</div>
<div class="feature">
  <div class="icon">
    🧠
  </div>
  <h3>
    Solve the Mystery
  </h3>
  <p>
    Connect the evidence, form a hypothesis,
    and see whether your reasoning solves the case.
  </p>
</div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="mission">
  <div class="mission-content">
<h2>
  Why ClueMD?
</h2>
<p>
  Science shouldn't only be something you memorize
  for an exam. ClueMD gives students a chance to
  investigate, ask questions, make connections,
  and learn through curiosity.
</p>
  </div>
</section>
<footer>
  ClueMD · Fictional educational science experience
</footer>
</body>
</html>
